---
manual: manip.before
lines: [2320, 2320]
testability: api
display: any
----------- app code
Shoes.app do
  $slot = stack { $last = para "last" }
  @go = button("Go") { $returned = $slot.before($last) { para "first" } }
end
----------- test code
button("@go").trigger_click
assert_same $slot, $returned, "before returns self"
